{
  "name": "dsh-purge",
  "version": "1.1.79-0.2.1.rc.2-fork1-b0-1",
  "description": "DeepSeek Harness 破甲：让所有模型都能破甲，不同模型可换不同提示词；默认提示词面向国模「小码酱」。Jailbreak for every model — swap prompts per model. 求 Star 收藏 ⭐ 如要二开，请查看署名要求部分",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./redteam": "./lib/redteam/index.js",
    "./redteam/store": "./lib/redteam/store.js",
    "./redteam/ui": "./lib/redteam/ui.js",
    "./redteam/tools": "./lib/redteam/tools.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "bin": {
    "dsh-purge": "bin/dsh-purge.js"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "!lib/default-prompt-inject.md",
    "bin",
    "docs",
    "presets",
    "skills",
    "scripts",
    "client.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "screenshots.json",
    "README.md",
    "README.zh-CN.md",
    "CHANGELOG-fork1.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "embed-prompt": "node scripts/embed-default-prompt.mjs",
    "build:client": "node scripts/build-client.mjs",
    "postinstall": "node scripts/ensure-profile-bundle.mjs"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "dsh-plugins",
    "网络安全",
    "红队评测",
    "llm-security",
    "harness-security",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "red-team",
    "instructions",
    "rules",
    "prompt-eval",
    "agent"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/YuJunZhiXue/dsh-purge.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/YuJunZhiXue/dsh-purge#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/YuJunZhiXue/dsh-purge/issues"
  },
  "dshPurgeFork": {
    "batch": "b0-1 — ①b0 的可见性探针（lib/probe.js：心跳 / apply·dispose·reload 生命周期 / purgeLog 调用计数 / 主日志落盘成败）②★修复：cordis.patch.yml 的主行从「id 覆盖」改回 insert —— fork1 照搬上游 1.1.75 `6980fe2` 的 already-queued 修法后，本 profile（dsh-purge 只在 dsh.profile.bundles 里）没有任何补丁再创建该行，组合器实测报 `patch: entry \"dsh-purge\" not found`，父插件因此永不装载（无 [boot]、无钩子、面板消失）。诊断全程见 dsh-purge-opt/26-*.md。",
    "note": "fork 基线 1.1.73-0.2.1.rc.2；已并入上游 1.1.74-1.1.78 的修复。核心号取 1.1.79 是为确保 lib/update.js 的 versionIsNewer 不把上游 1.1.78 判为更新（否则手动检查更新会整批覆盖回上游代码）。",
    "base": "1.1.73-0.2.1.rc.2",
    "upstreamPorts": ["1.1.74", "1.1.75", "1.1.76", "1.1.78"],
    "upstreamRepo": "https://github.com/YuJunZhiXue/dsh-purge"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings"
      ]
    },
    "install": {
      "preferred": "tarball",
      "tarball": "https://codeload.github.com/cxkctrl24-lgtm/dsh-purge-021/tar.gz/refs/heads/main",
      "zip": "https://codeload.github.com/cxkctrl24-lgtm/dsh-purge-021/zip/refs/heads/main",
      "git": "https://github.com/cxkctrl24-lgtm/dsh-purge-021.git"
    }
  },
  "publishConfig": {
    "access": "public"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.1"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=18"
  },
  "dshTarget": "0.2.1-rc.2"
}
